# Pin the encryption key so it no longer lives only in one file (/home/node/.n8n/config) in one volume.
# Use the value that ALREADY encrypted your credentials: the "encryptionKey" field of the existing config file.
# A different value gives "Mismatching encryption keys" (file vs variable) or, on n8n 2.x, a startup crash:
#   Error: Deployment key 'signing.hmac' cannot be read with this instance encryption key
# (both reproduced on n8n 2.41.3, 2026-09-30). In queue mode every worker needs the same value.
N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY=<value of "encryptionKey" from your existing .n8n/config>
